From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000001 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alps Extended Images <noreply@cscs.ch>
Date: Fri, 12 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] csrc: include <cstdint> for int64_t

clang 23 (ROCm 10) does not transitively define int64_t through the
HIP runtime headers anymore. cuda_utils.h declares int64_t functions
with only <stdio.h> included, so the hipified ROCm build fails with
"unknown type name 'int64_t'".
---
 csrc/cuda_utils.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/csrc/cuda_utils.h b/csrc/cuda_utils.h
--- a/csrc/cuda_utils.h
+++ b/csrc/cuda_utils.h
@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
 #pragma once
 
 #include <stdio.h>
+#include <cstdint>
 
 #if defined(__HIPCC__)
